{"unit_id":"a903067276-rgb__dsh-plan-switch#card-zh","repo":"a903067276-rgb/dsh-plan-switch","commit":"c4b32611eec1b5c4992f01353f60801b78075e61","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plan-switch 是一款面向 DSH Web 的界面插件，在对话输入框工具栏左侧注册清单图标按钮。它读取当前会话的 Plan 投影状态，点击按钮时调用官方 /plan 命令进入 Plan 模式，并在状态生效后隐藏按钮，避免和官方状态卡片重复显示；切换等待期间会禁用按钮，命令失败时显示错误提示。适合希望从输入框快速进入 Plan 模式的 DSH Web 用户。需要 DSH Web 和 pnpm 安装环境，不需要 API Key 或额外外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:46-104","package.json:49-55"]}
{"unit_id":"a903067276-rgb__dsh-plan-switch#card-en","repo":"a903067276-rgb/dsh-plan-switch","commit":"c4b32611eec1b5c4992f01353f60801b78075e61","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plan-switch adds a checklist button to the DSH web composer. Clicking it calls /plan to enter Plan mode; the button hides while Plan is active and disables during a pending switch. It displays command errors. This helps users access Plan mode from the input bar without typing a command.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:46-104","package.json:49-55"]}
