{"unit_id":"a903067276-rgb__dsh-plan-switch#caveat-direction","repo":"a903067276-rgb/dsh-plan-switch","commit":"c4b32611eec1b5c4992f01353f60801b78075e61","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plan-switch 使用前须知：按钮在 Plan 激活时隐藏，点击只用于进入模式；退出需使用 DSH 官方入口，README 的进出描述不完全符合实现（见 lib/client.js:65-68,92）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:65-68","lib/client.js:90-94"]}
